\[
\sigma_{P,\text{stress}}
=
10\sigma_P.
\]

Extreme stiffness:
\[
\Delta t_{\text{stress}}
=
0.1\Delta t.
\]

Neural ODE saturation:
\[
\mathbf{h}(t)
\leftarrow
\min(\mathbf{h}(t),\, h_{\text{max}}).
\]

\section{Summary}

The Numerical Integration Engine provides a robust, adaptive, and secure
framework for advancing the MPS--PCE global state. Its hybrid RK45, Heun,
Euler–Maruyama, and neural ODE solvers ensure stability and accuracy across
multiscale biological dynamics, while its distributed execution and
cryptographic verification guarantee reliability and integrity.